% n18: HURKENS WITNESS -- the FULL paradox, 300 nodes, authored 2026-09-13.
% Discriminates against n15_hurkens_full, which stopped at `tau sigma` (a nonsense
% application, rc=24 for a reason unrelated to universes) and against n02, which
% is only the (box,*) door. This file walks all the way to the self-application.
%
% THE CONSTRUCTION, in this calculus (Sort 0 = Hurkens' *, Sort 1 = box, Sort 2 = triangle):
%   bot    : Sort 0            := Pi p:Sort 0. p                          needs imax  ((box,*))
%   neg    : Sort 0 -> Sort 0  := \p. p -> bot
%   pow X  := X -> Sort 0                                                  (n11's shape)
%   U      := Pi X:Sort 1. (pow(pow X) -> X) -> pow(pow X)   Hurkens needs U : Sort 1 ((triangle,box))
%   tau    : pow(pow U) -> U   := \t X f p. t (\x:U. p (f (x X f)))        arm-independent
%   sigma  : U -> pow(pow U)   := \s:U. s U tau                            `s U` needs U : Sort 1
%   Delta  : pow U := \y. neg (Pi p:pow U. sigma y p -> p (tau (sigma y)))  needs imax
%   Omega  : U     := tau (\p:pow U. Pi x:U. sigma x p -> p x)              needs imax
%   lemma1 : Pi p. (Pi x. sigma x p -> p x) -> p Omega
%   lemma2 : neg (Pi p. (Pi x. sigma x p -> p x) -> p Omega)
%   paradox : bot := lemma2 lemma1
%
% WHERE IT IS REJECTED, measured 2026-09-13 on tkernel.bin 7a898cdf and the twin:
%   max  arm: at `def bot` -- Sort 1 claimed at Sort 0 (kernel 26; twin "declared
%             Sort 0 but the body has type Sort 1"). The (box,*) door is shut.
%   imax arm: bot, neg, U and the WHOLE of tau pass (tau's `x X f` is the delta
%             unfolding of const U that 502d17a landed); sigma is rejected at `s U`
%             (kernel 24; twin "expected Sort 1, got Sort 2"). That is the
%             (triangle,box) rule: U quantifies over Sort 1 so it lives in Sort 2,
%             and the paradox needs it in the sort it quantifies over. Only Sort 0
%             is impredicative under imax, so the door one level up stays shut.
% This is a UNIVERSE rejection, not plumbing: the same file with `def U : Sort 1`
% (the paradox's own typing) is rejected by both arms at U itself (26), and a
% scratch twin carrying the (triangle,box) rule -- lambda-U-minus, which Hurkens
% proved inconsistent -- ACCEPTS that variant in full, 10206 fuel. So the encoding
% is the real paradox and the kernel refuses it at exactly the rule that matters.
% Removing the impredicative content (everything from sigma on) FLIPS the verdict
% between the arms: max 26, imax 0 -- the fixture measures the imax rule, not noise.
%
% U is declared at Sort 2, its honest sort, so that the kernel reaches sigma.
% tau's declared codomain spells U's body out because the kernel's k_conv is
% structural (no delta); with `const U` there the kernel would reject tau with 26
% for a reason that has nothing to do with universes.
% Every node is FRESH (no sharing, per n08) -- duplication is the prescribed remedy,
% and 300 nodes is the price. Generated by an elaborator over a named term; the
% de Bruijn indices below are mechanical, not hand-counted.

